<title>USA: Chrysler June US car sales fall 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Chrysler June US car sales fall 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    72,480	    84,731	    -14.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 147,276	   143,754	     +2.5</p>
<p> Import Car		     0		 343	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
